eenshots01.png", "id": "235918228322285", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974469_235918231655618_9200480916509836758_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LB_Fo3tXWjkQ7kNvwGtfmOc&_nc_oc=Adn3JXQMMmDfHfDCSkyncjGhqkLwLe4F3FNuf67wjeL15nOdi7O-U09gs8RT-3DV3BU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxNn2woTl0fse4_ZE_2WCh3ayfM4si2G6-kdn6JHfRRUA&oe=69B539DC"}, {"file_name": "SMVRFinalQuestScreenshots02.png", "id": "1202634946843386", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982715_1202634950176719_6841690957288523386_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-Rh7od2z8PUQ7kNvwHxqFrH&_nc_oc=AdnVkv8QZKm8a6aT6K6_pC5dFQmygWoZhNJqzy-QQNgEWUwx53o3VJgSH3fxJzyN8bo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwE9I15TDOaqrvTf2jThLX09zFc1uHEzijN9eAdSZKY6w&oe=69B54CA5"}, {"file_name": "SMVRFinalQuestScreenshots13.png", "id": "528250488391317", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001721_528250491724650_1577659830106612444_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_FCArXjTkiUQ7kNvwEC79Kn&_nc_oc=AdnyNPszgoEbVFcJlsMoTof9np1xJKF6J6jIORb1bOv4wm9sl_TDDh73Dkqe8cSpgcQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzypGGFEaCELmjYlMFltD0lF-f05s9QWtdeyRrlD08z-w&oe=69B540EC"}, {"file_name": "SMVRFinalQuestScreenshots10.png", "id": "326371915829001", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974680_326371919162334_129873048362627550_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xqbnDc2r17UQ7kNvwGDPEM7&_nc_oc=AdmqgrHYef4FkU0YQkGzzOY5djzvvPE2RWEp5UWUzMmtXgwWrBRoPxT5MH3tm67jv_Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwCnCqmUGN16QD4zgTagATTprqpDv-ETXxSpD7eb4m51w&oe=69B546AF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "OculusCover2560x1440VIDEOENDSLATEWITHLEGAL.png", "id": "321306219352083", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035305_321306222685416_4438699296036008856_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8lK48Fr2Zp4Q7kNvwHWD09M&_nc_oc=AdmdYazprcyec57ZO8dYkCblYMhqklsskMtzom-83DzEdTccjULyeHm2RtVHwernM_k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxtjSgFFXYSBR35fNGWw3kX6PoShI_XtHIZR4vM4ty86Q&oe=69B56656"}, "display_name": "Sam and Max: This Time It's Virtual!", "keywords": ["Comedy", "Adventure", "Narrative", "Action", "Arcade"], "long_description": "Sam is a dog with a hat.  Max is a hyperkinetic naked rabbity thing.  Together, they\u2019re the Freelance Police, the intergalactically famous agents of indiscriminately applied justice, now starring in their umpteenth video game, Sam & Max: This Time It\u2019s Virtual!  Even multimedia evil-slappers like Sam & Max could use a hand, and this time they\u2019re using the incomprehensible magic of virtual reality to invite the player into their off-kilter world for a furious day of monster-slaying, obstacle courses, responsibly discharged firearms, and, of course, saving the entire freaking world.\nKey features:\n\u2022Discover the horrible and socially relevant secrets lurking behind, under, and within Cap\u2019n Aquabear\u2019s rotting theme park!\n\u2022Push yourself to be the best of the best of the middling, as a dog and a naked rabbity thing harangue and cajole you through a bewildering assortment of Freelance Police Academy training challenges.\n\u2022Immersion so real you can feel Sam\u2019s breath on your neck!\n", "short_description": "Sam is a dog in a suit.  Max is his naked rabbity partner.  Together, they\u2019re the Freelance Police.  Jump into the not-quite-right world of Sam & Max via the wonder science of virtual reality, and join the multimedia darlings in their never-ending quest to slap the stupid grin off the face of evil."}]}, "developer_name": "HappyGiant", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://happygiant.com/terms-of-service", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://happygiant.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_nam